OL,3,AHospitals deliberately targeted by
OL,4,ASudan's RSF fighters, BBC finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe RSF has rejected the BBC's
OL,7,Ffindings.
OL,9,FThe paramilitary group's health
OL,10,Fminister described the allegations as
OL,11,Fpropaganda and a deliberate attempt by
OL,12,Fthe national army and its allies to
OL,13,Fsmear the RSF's reputation.
